{
  "key": "pr-1827",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "build-mobile: pin Flutter to exact 3.47.7 (daily TestFlight SDK-download failure)",
    "description": "Root cause of today's daily TestFlight failure (run 40066130883 → child 40066198778): the `3.47.x` wildcard re-resolved to **3.47.8**, uncached on the runner → 2.27 GB SDK download blew the bounded curl budget (600s/attempt; 1.48 GB received when it timed out).\n\nExact **3.47.7** is cached on every fa-m5 runner and matches the desktop lane (post-#1815) → zero download, deterministic SDK per run.\n\nAfter merge: re-dispatch the iOS leg (or wait for the daily) — TestFlight green → **#1735 auto-closes by its own mechanism**.\n\nCloses #1826"
  }
}

